{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Anyone with hairfall &amp; damaged hair<br> Someone with hairfall post kertain, colour or chemical treatments<br> Someone searching for a rice hair mask<br> Anyone looking to restore hair shine and volume</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Rice Whey Protein, Distilled Aloe Vera Water, Distilled Hibiscus Leaves Water, Cold Pressed Sunflower Oil, Cold Pressed Almond Oil, Cold Pressed Castor Oil, Hibiscus Leaf Oil, Daruharidra, Chamomile Essential Oil, Bhringraj Oil, Vanilla, Bergamot, Ylang ylang essential oil, Par-kera extract, Clove infused argan oil, Cetyl Alcohol, Staryl Alcohol, BTMS 50, Vegetable Glycerin, Shea butter, Vitamin E, Stearic acid, Behentrimonium chloride, Cetrimonium chloride, Propylene glycol, Polyquaternium-7, Polyquaternium-10, Hydrolysed Collagen, Hydrolysed keratin, Vitamin B5, Aloevera gel, Niacinamide, Hydrolised wheat protein, Lactic acid, Natural betaine</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>If your hair has been damaged by color, kertain or chemical treatments at the salon, this product is for you. It restores hair health and delivers essential amino acids that repair damaged hair.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>A very unique formula that is made to repair damaged hair due to chemical treatments. It uses rice whey, which is widely used in Korean beauty products but also has roots in India! It has mild preservatives and is much more natural than common conditioners available in the market</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
